PC1 is a **mixed-domain axis**, not a single-domain axis. Its positive pole organises
*long-distance prestige and settlement-monumentality* (ZCU_AU, Zkeverz, ZHort, ZAxtSchwert,
ZDolch, ZMonument, ZMW, Zhausgr) while its negative pole organises *subsistence-economy
and pottery-form elaboration* (ZKeform, ZBeil, ZAmber, ZSichel).

